# Amerika OS seed structure (germinate-style, as used by Ubuntu flavours).
# Each seed becomes a metapackage; "needs" lists seeds whose packages it already pulls in.
# The authoritative package list for each metapackage lives in the seed file of the same name.
# tools/builders/flavor.py turns these seeds into Depends/Recommends/Suggests of the metapackages.
#
# seed:             metapackage            needs
standard:           amerika-standard       -
desktop-minimal:    amerika-desktop-minimal standard
desktop:            amerika-desktop        -                 (defined in build.py, not generated here)
desktop-full:       amerika-desktop-full   desktop
live:               amerika-live           desktop
installer:          amerika-installer-config -
